\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {2}{Spatial benchmark: mean~$\pm $~SD of five repeats, each in a fresh process. CPU: one DGX H100 node (\texttt  {poddgx02}, 100 CPUs), the reference; GPU: one RTX 4090. Speedup: ratio of mean totals with 95\% bootstrap interval; the next column uses the 128-thread workstation CPU as reference. At Visium HD 8~\textmu {}m the totals include co-occurrence, whose GPU result with rapids-singlecell 0.14.1 was incorrect; without it the totals are 616 s (CPU) and 89.7 s (GPU) and the speedup is 6.9$\times $ (6.8-6.9) (6.1$\times $ with the workstation CPU). Memory: mean of the per-repeat peaks (GiB); GPU VRAM includes the RMM pool.}}{8}{table.2}\protected@file@percent }
